<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Micro started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Micro started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Charles Boucher started coverage of Trident Microsystems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates calendar year 1996 earnings at $1.07 per share and calendar 1997 earnings at $1.54 per share.</p>
<p>-- Said company currently trades at &quot;a deep discount to virtually every other semiconductor stock and other multimedia chip stocks.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares up 1/16 to 11-3/16.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
